    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40834" root="هبج" body-key="h">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هبّجهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَهْبِيجٌ</span>, <i>It caused him,</i> or <i>it,</i>
[a camel's udder], <i>to become swollen;</i> or <i>to have
a tumour</i> [or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَبَج</span>]. (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هبّج وَجْهَهُ</span> [<i>It
rendered his face swollen:</i> see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَبِجَ</span>:] said of much
sleep. (TA, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رهل</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هبّج</span> <i>He killed</i> a
dog, [app. by beating]. (L.)

